{"seq":1,"slug":"case-workflow-assignment","title":"争议案件工作流与分派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/case-workflow-assignment","wordCount":1502,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"争议案件工作流与分派\">争议案件工作流与分派</h1><p>当拒付从每天几件变成每天几百件，案件处理的瓶颈从「知不知道怎么举证」转向「有没有人按正确顺序处理」。争议案件有几个对分派很不友好的特性：它们的<strong>截止时间是硬性的且各案不同</strong>，它们的<strong>处理成本差异极大</strong>（一个妥投证明和一个跨三系统的欺诈取证不是一个量级），而且它们的<strong>处理能力是有限的</strong>（人工复核席位固定）。这意味着分派不是简单的队列消费，而是一个<strong>在时限约束下分配稀缺注意力的调度问题</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-案件状态模型\">核心概念：案件状态模型</h2><p>争议案件的状态必须与网络阶段解耦。网络阶段是外部事实（见 <a href=\"../chargeback-lifecycle/dispute-stage-deadline\">争议阶段与响应时限</a>），而内部状态表达「我方处理进展」。两者不能混成一个字段，否则你无法表达「网络在 chargeback 阶段，而我们的举证还在组装中」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; New&#10;  New --&gt; Triaged: 关联交易 + 读取原因码规则&#10;  Triaged --&gt; AutoHandling: 命中自动处置策略&#10;  Triaged --&gt; Assigned: 需人工&#10;  Assigned --&gt; InProgress: 处理人认领&#10;  InProgress --&gt; EvidenceBlocked: 关键证据缺失&#10;  EvidenceBlocked --&gt; InProgress: 补齐或降级&#10;  InProgress --&gt; Submitted: 提交举证&#10;  Submitted --&gt; AwaitingResult: 等待网络受理&#10;  AwaitingResult --&gt; Won: 举证被接受&#10;  AwaitingResult --&gt; Escalated: 举证被拒,评估升级&#10;  AwaitingResult --&gt; Lost: 超时或认赔&#10;  AutoHandling --&gt; Won&#10;  AutoHandling --&gt; Lost&#10;  Escalated --&gt; Submitted&#10;  Won --&gt; [*]&#10;  Lost --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; New\n  New --&gt; Triaged: 关联交易 + 读取原因码规则\n  Triaged --&gt; AutoHandling: 命中自动处置策略\n  Triaged --&gt; Assigned: 需人工\n  Assigned --&gt; InProgress: 处理人认领\n  InProgress --&gt; EvidenceBlocked: 关键证据缺失\n  EvidenceBlocked --&gt; InProgress: 补齐或降级\n  InProgress --&gt; Submitted: 提交举证\n  Submitted --&gt; AwaitingResult: 等待网络受理\n  AwaitingResult --&gt; Won: 举证被接受\n  AwaitingResult --&gt; Escalated: 举证被拒,评估升级\n  AwaitingResult --&gt; Lost: 超时或认赔\n  AutoHandling --&gt; Won\n  AutoHandling --&gt; Lost\n  Escalated --&gt; Submitted\n  Won --&gt; [*]\n  Lost --&gt; [*]</pre><p>关键设计点：<code>EvidenceBlocked</code> 是<strong>一等的状态</strong>，不是异常。大量案件卡在这里（承运商接口拿不到妥投记录、3DS 日志已轮转），把它显式建模才能统计「有多少损失是因为证据取不到」——这是完全不同的一类缺陷（见 <a href=\"../evidence-representment/evidence-package-assembly\">举证包自动组装</a> 的降级策略）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级排序\">优先级排序</h2><p>分派的核心输入是<strong>紧迫度</strong>与<strong>价值</strong>两个维度。紧迫度来自时限，价值来自金额与胜诉期望。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序查询\">排序查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT c.id,&#10;       c.amount_value,&#10;       c.reason_family,&#10;       t.due_at,&#10;       TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, NOW(), t.due_at) AS hours_left,&#10;       -- 归一化紧迫度：越接近到期越高，已超时为负&#10;       (1.0 / GREATEST(TIMESTAMPDIFF(HOUR, NOW(), t.due_at), 1)) AS urgency,&#10;       -- 期望价值：金额 × 该原因码历史胜率&#10;       c.amount_value * COALESCE(w.win_rate, 0.3) AS expected_value&#10;FROM dispute_case c&#10;JOIN dispute_stage_timeline t ON t.dispute_case_id = c.id AND t.submitted_at IS NULL&#10;LEFT JOIN reason_win_rate w ON w.reason_code = c.frozen_reason_code&#10;WHERE c.state IN (&#39;New&#39;,&#39;Triaged&#39;,&#39;Assigned&#39;)&#10;ORDER BY urgency DESC, expected_value DESC&#10;LIMIT 200;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reason_family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">due_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       TIMESTAMPDIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HOUR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">due_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_left,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 归一化紧迫度：越接近到期越高，已超时为负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TIMESTAMPDIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HOUR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">due_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urgency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 期望价值：金额 × 该原因码历史胜率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">win_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_case c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_stage_timeline t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">submitted_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reason_win_rate w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reason_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_reason_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'New'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Triaged'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Assigned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urgency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, expected_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个排序有意让<strong>紧迫度优先于价值</strong>：一件即将超时的小额案件，其损失是确定的（本金 + 网络费用 + 拒付率计数），而一件大额但还有 20 天的案件损失是不确定的。同时 <code>w.win_rate</code> 让同一个队列里「大概率能赢」的案件排在前面，避免把人工注意力投给注定失败的主张。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分派的三个约束\">分派的三个约束</h3><p>排序只给出理想顺序，真实分派还要满足三个约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时限硬约束</td>\n<td>超时不可逆</td>\n<td>到期前 N 小时强制提升优先级/触发兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力约束</td>\n<td>人工席位有限，且技能不同</td>\n<td>按原因码家族路由到对应技能组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租约约束</td>\n<td>同一案件不能被两人同时处理</td>\n<td>认领时加租约，超时自动释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二个约束的经济含义常被低估：<strong>让熟悉欺诈取证的人去做妥投核验是浪费</strong>。按原因码家族分技能组，让简单案件走轻量通道（甚至全自动），是把有限人力用在关键处的直接手段。</p>\n<p>第三项约束的实现细节值得写清楚，因为争议案件存在「同案多人」的真实场景（客服已联系持卡人、风控在补设备信息、争议专员在组装证据）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE case_lease (&#10;  dispute_case_id BIGINT      NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  holder          VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  acquired_at     DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  expires_at      DATETIME(3) NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;-- 认领：仅当无人持有或租约已过期时成功&#10;INSERT INTO case_lease (dispute_case_id, holder, acquired_at, expires_at)&#10;VALUES (?, ?, NOW(3), NOW(3) + INTERVAL 30 MINUTE)&#10;ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE&#10;  holder     = IF(expires_at &lt; NOW(3), VALUES(holder), holder),&#10;  acquired_at= IF(expires_at &lt; NOW(3), VALUES(acquired_at), acquired_at),&#10;  expires_at = IF(expires_at &lt; NOW(3), VALUES(expires_at), expires_at);&#10;&#10;-- 判断是否抢到&#10;SELECT holder = ? AS acquired FROM case_lease WHERE dispute_case_id = ?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_lease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  holder          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acquired_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 认领：仅当无人持有或租约已过期时成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_lease (dispute_case_id, holder, acquired_at, expires_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (?, ?, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> MINUTE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DUPLICATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  holder     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(holder), holder),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acquired_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(acquired_at), acquired_at),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expires_at), expires_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判断是否抢到</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acquired </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_lease </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>租约要<strong>短于</strong>人工处理的典型间隔（30 分钟是常见选择），并允许处理人主动续租。租约到期自动释放的副作用是可能被两人先后处理，所以<strong>提交动作本身还要幂等</strong>——这是 <a href=\"../evidence-representment/representment-template-network\">举证模板与网络门户/API 提交</a> 里幂等键的作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动与人工的路由边界\">自动与人工的路由边界</h2><p>不是所有案件都值得人工介入。路由规则应当以「判定复杂度」而非「金额」为主轴：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件组合</th>\n<th>路由</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动化白名单原因码 + 证据齐全 + 低于金额阈值</td>\n<td>全自动提交</td>\n<td>判定规则确定，无需判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3DS 责任转移成立</td>\n<td>全自动应答</td>\n<td>结论无歧义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据齐全但原因码需叙事</td>\n<td>自动组装 + 人工确认</td>\n<td>需人写 narrative 与选 response_code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键证据缺失</td>\n<td>人工（含认赔建议）</td>\n<td>需权衡升级或止损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高金额或已进入升级阶段</td>\n<td>人工（需审批）</td>\n<td>风险与费用高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>路由表应当<strong>可热更新</strong>：网络规则调整或证据能力提升后，能立刻把一类案件从人工转全自动，而不必发版。同时要监控路由比例，若「需人工」的比例持续上升，通常意味着某个上游能力退化（例如某承运商接口不再返回签收地址），而不是案件本身变难了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吞吐与积压治理\">吞吐与积压治理</h2><p>争议案件有<strong>季节性峰值</strong>（大促后、假期后争议集中爆发），所以容量规划要按峰值而不是均值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个治理手段\">三个治理手段</h3><p>三个实用的手段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提前处理</strong>：不要等到临近时限才处理。<code>hours_left</code> 的分布若严重右偏（大量案件挤在最后 24 小时），说明队列在积压，应当把窗口前移到 72 小时。</li>\n<li><strong>降级通道</strong>：为低价值案件准备一键认赔通道，把人工从无意义的工作里释放出来。</li>\n<li><strong>分批提交</strong>：网络接口通常有限流，提交任务要按网络的时间窗口与速率限制排队，避免批量重试触发封禁。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>积压最危险的形态是<strong>静默积压</strong>：队列长度正常，但案件都堆在即将到期的那一段。监控应当盯 <code>hours_left</code> 的分布而不是队列总长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内部处理状态必须与网络阶段解耦；<code>EvidenceBlocked</code> 应作为一等状态以暴露证据缺失类缺陷。</li>\n<li>优先级排序以紧迫度优先、期望价值次之，期望价值 = 金额 × 该原因码历史胜率。</li>\n<li>分派受三类约束：时限硬约束、技能组能力约束、同案租约约束。</li>\n<li>认领用租约 + 自动释放实现，但提交动作本身仍须幂等以防租约失效后的重复处理。</li>\n<li>自动/人工路由以判定复杂度为主轴，路由表可热更新并监控比例漂移。</li>\n<li>积压治理看 <code>hours_left</code> 分布而非队列长度；峰值容量按大促后争议潮规划。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新案件] --&gt; B[关联交易 + 冻结规则]&#10;  B --&gt; C{命中自动白名单?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D{3DS 责任转移?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[自动应答]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[自动提交举证]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| G[按原因码家族路由技能组]&#10;  G --&gt; H{证据齐全?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[EvidenceBlocked 人工]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J{高金额/升级?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[人工 + 审批]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[自动组装 + 人工确认]&#10;  I --&gt; M[认赔或补证]\">graph TD\n  A[新案件] --&gt; B[关联交易 + 冻结规则]\n  B --&gt; C{命中自动白名单?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D{3DS 责任转移?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[自动应答]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[自动提交举证]\n  C --&gt;|否| G[按原因码家族路由技能组]\n  G --&gt; H{证据齐全?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[EvidenceBlocked 人工]\n  H --&gt;|是| J{高金额/升级?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[人工 + 审批]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[自动组装 + 人工确认]\n  I --&gt; M[认赔或补证]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"争议案件工作流与分派","id":"争议案件工作流与分派"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：案件状态模型","id":"核心概念-案件状态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级排序","id":"优先级排序"},{"level":3,"text":"排序查询","id":"排序查询"},{"level":3,"text":"分派的三个约束","id":"分派的三个约束"},{"level":2,"text":"自动与人工的路由边界","id":"自动与人工的路由边界"},{"level":2,"text":"吞吐与积压治理","id":"吞吐与积压治理"},{"level":3,"text":"三个治理手段","id":"三个治理手段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pre-arbitration 与仲裁阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/evidence-representment/arbitration-pre-arbitration"},"next":{"title":"胜诉率与败诉归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/win-rate-root-cause"}}